# 3D asset pipeline — source and working files, never the repository's job.
#
# A manufacturer .max or an exported .fbx is production input: large, binary,
# and reproducible from the share URL recorded in the handoff manifest. Only
# the reviewed runtime GLB under public/assets/3d/ is the app's to carry, and
# only after it has passed QA.
assets/3d/received/
assets/3d/workspace/
assets/3d/source/
*.max
*.fbx
*.3ds
*.skp
*.rfa
*.rvt

# 3D conversion workspace — raw manufacturer sources and intermediate output.
# Reports and screenshots under assets/3d/work are deliberately NOT ignored:
# they are the record of why an asset passed.
assets/3d/work/incoming/
assets/3d/work/normalized/

# Raw manufacturer geometry sources. Kept out of the repo for size and because
# redistribution terms for manufacturer planning assets are not established
# (see §73/§74 licence review). data/3d/manufacturer-sources.json records each
# file's hash, size and inspection verdict, which is the part worth keeping.
assets/3d/sources/
